<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>About - ASD Screening System</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="aboutus">
    <nav>
        <div class="left">
            <a href="/home">Home</a>
            <a href="/screen">Screening</a>
            <a href="/dashboard">Records</a>
            <a href="/community">Community</a>
        </div>
        <div class="right">
            <% if (user) { %>
                <span class="user-greeting">Hi, <%= user.username %></span>
                <button><a href="/logout">Logout</a></button>
            <% } else { %>
                <button><a href="/login">Login</a></button>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="about-hero">
        <h1>Clinical Decision Support for ASD</h1>
        <p>Harnessing multilayer artificial neural networks to provide rapid, accessible toddler neurodevelopmental assessments.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section class="vision-mission">
        <div class="vision">
            <h2>Our Purpose</h2>
            <p>Early identification of Autism Spectrum Disorder remains essential for early intervention. Our goal is to reduce screening delays by providing an automated triage tool based on the internationally validated Q-CHAT-10 framework.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mission">
            <h2>Inference Architecture</h2>
            <p>Our backend employs a Multilayer Perceptron neural network trained on standardized toddler clinical data. The model evaluates social communication, joint attention, and demographic indicators to output calibrated risk probabilities.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <section class="impact">
        <h2>Clinical Advisory Note</h2>
        <p>This software operates strictly as a preliminary screening mechanism. Any elevated likelihood flag generated by the neural network must be confirmed by formal multidisciplinary assessments performed by a certified developmental pediatrician or child psychologist.</p>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
        <h3>Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD) Neural Screening System</h3>
        <p>A clinical decision-support tool. Not a substitute for formal psychiatric evaluation.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>